; INSTALL.DEF — module definition for Family API NE link
;
; Target: NE binary matching Clark's INSTALL.EXE header:
;   Linker 5.10, Target OS 0x01 (OS/2), Flags 0x0002 (MULTIPLEDATA)
;   Imports: DOSCALLS, KBDCALLS, VIOCALLS (Family API)
;   6 segments, stack 8000
;
; Used by TLINK 5.1 via: TLINK /Twe ... , ... , ... , ... , INSTALL.DEF

NAME INSTALL WINDOWCOMPAT
DESCRIPTION 'PCBoard Install'
EXETYPE OS/2
PROTMODE
STACKSIZE 8192
HEAPSIZE 0
